+P0.1g Acceptance 1         HOLD — ORIGINAL · BLOCKED / NO VERIFIED PATH · NOT FAILED
+CFC-1                      INTRODUCED — upper-layer fault containment acceptance
+DOMAIN_BLOCKED             LEGALIZED (L2 — see Failure Domain Contract)
