+Implementation             NOT AUTHORIZED (except Phase A gate)
+Lab                        NOT AUTHORIZED
+```
+
+---
+
+## Phase A authorization boundary (reference)
+
+Phase A is **not authorized by this document alone**. When separately authorized:
